<tab><cl=F0F010>CHARON<cl=A2A2A2><br><br>
<tab>Players with bad <l="hts:\\language\i_charact.hts">karma<\l> after death can be reborn on Charon.  The territory of Charon is severely disfigured, practically barren, impassable and densely populated by monsters. Getting out of Charon is not easy, although it is possible.<br>
